       }
      ],
      "text": "QRS:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " USU < 120 ms unless there = a pre-existing bundle branch block, an accessory pathway, or rate-related aberrant conduction"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
