       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Mimic:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " musc tremor or electrical interference can resemble f waves, but the underlying ventricular rhythm = regular"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
