      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Focal activate:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " AF starts from a focus of ↑automaticity or μ re-entry, often in the pulm veins"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
