       }
      ],
      "text": "Less common Eti:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " PE, ASD and other congenital ♡ defects, COPD, sleep apnea, myocarditis, pericarditis"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
