      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Also:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " acute infections, lyte disturb (hypokalemia, hypomagnesemia), thyrotoxicosis, drugs (ex, sympathomimetics), EToH, pulm Emb, pericardial dz, acid-base disturb, pre-excitation syndromes"
     }
    ]
   },
