      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Exam:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " irregularly irreg pulse, loss of a waves in the JVP; a pulse deficit (apical rate faster than the wrist rate) may be present"
     }
    ]
   },
