     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Rate-control drugs:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " BBs (ex, metoprolol, esmolol), preferred if excess catecholamines are sus (ex, thyroid disorders, exercise-triggered cases); nondihydropyridine CCBs (verapamil, diltiazem); digoxin = least effective but may be preferred in HF"
     }
    ]
   },
